   "framerName": "Process V2",
   "items": [
    {
     "t": "code",
     "text": "THE SDR CEILING"
    },
    {
     "t": "h2",
     "text": "Your SDRs are researching, not selling"
    },
    {
     "t": "h2",
     "text": "LinkedIn closes 25% of meetings vs. 15% from cold email - it’s your best channel and your lowest-volume one. Each rep maxes out at 20 quality touches a day because the research is manual. So you’re stuck choosing between hiring you can’t afford and a quality ceiling you can’t break."
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/cSfuUaRCe6mtjQgGygGXc0Ms.png",
     "box": "1344x56"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "70% of the day on grunt work"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Pulling lists, researching prospects, drafting \"personalized\" messages. Your smartest reps spend three hours a day on the part a tool should do."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "SELLING TIME LOST TO RESEARCH"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/0WWjyvAaj9FemoWYIj02vT4iyDM.png",
     "box": "448x274"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/wbD2M1e4heMO5vhFyOVSd06raU.png",
     "box": "327x238"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "A third SDR costs $8,300/mo"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Salary, tools, three months of ramp - and they still hit the same manual ceiling. The board wants more pipeline. The CEO said no more headcount until Q3."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "THE HIRE YOU CAN'T GET APPROVED"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/pcdOvBzgiyoCEwCOpF4fCU2wFE.png",
     "box": "448x274"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/KXmPUH6iN7kM8tUEwzTIvGKjKw.png",
     "box": "327x238"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "Bad AI messages annoy prospects"
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "You tried an AI SDR. The messages were generic enough that AEs complained prospects arrived irritated. One cringe message burns a name you can't get back."
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "text": "BRAND DAMAGE FROM GENERIC AI"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/d2ZWq2gqUINlAfjT4c6EGNOvcE.png",
     "box": "448x274"
    },
    {
     "img": "/assets/pages/landing/img/A7eybC2DWbIXqCqH5pElLOD4s.png",
     "box": "327x238"
    }
   ]
